  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Tier 2 — Survivors / Militia</strong></p><p><strong>“We were here before your grand strategy, and we’ll be here after it catches fire.”</strong></p><p>Survivors and militias are what happens when ordinary people become infrastructure. They patch walls, ration supplies, drag neighbors out of burning buildings, and keep the faction alive long after cleaner doctrines would have folded.</p><p><em>You’ve moved from scraping by to teaching scarcity some manners.</em></p><ul><li><strong>Tactical:</strong> —</li><li><strong>Strategic:</strong> During resource regeneration, your faction gains +10% additional OP regeneration.</li></ul>",
